# =============================================================================
#  NHL-DLBCL — repository exclusions
#
#  Guiding rule: the repository carries CODE, PROTOCOLS, and RESULT TABLES.
#  Bulk data and images go to the Zenodo deposit and are referenced by DOI.
#  Source datasets are never redistributed — they are pointed at, with
#  checksums, via the PROVENANCE.md files that ARE tracked.
#
#  Working-tree totals at the time this file was written:
#    DLBCLMorph.zip           30.3 GB      source dataset archive
#    DLBCLMorph/              14.0 GB      extracted source dataset
#    kaggle_upload_staging/   13.9 GB      staging copies for Kaggle uploads
#    data/raw/.../cell_shapes.csv 356 MB   released source table
#    kaggle/ *.parquet         157 MB      derived per-object tables
#    kaggle/ *.png             225 MB      QC overlays
#    reports/ contact sheets   130 MB      QC contact sheets
#    models/he.tar             432 MB      third-party pretrained weights
#  Everything above is excluded. What remains is roughly 10 MB of code,
#  protocols, figures and result tables.
# =============================================================================

# --- Source dataset: 44 GB, and not ours to redistribute ---------------------
# DLBCL-Morph is CC BY-NC 4.0 from TCIA/figshare. Re-hosting it here would
# duplicate a public archive and muddy its licence terms. The download
# instructions and MD5s live in data/raw/dlbcl_morph/PROVENANCE.md (tracked).
/DLBCLMorph.zip
/DLBCLMorph/
/kaggle_upload_staging/
/data/raw/*
!/data/raw/dlbcl_morph
/data/raw/dlbcl_morph/*
!/data/raw/dlbcl_morph/PROVENANCE.md
!/data/raw/gse181063
/data/raw/gse181063/*
!/data/raw/gse181063/PROVENANCE.md

# --- Route 1 source downloads: ~282 MB, re-downloadable ----------------------
# GEO series/platform files, PMC full texts and the GSE31312 supplement PDF.
# Each is SHA-256 hashed in route1/manifests/source_registry.csv or the WP1
# audit; GSE181063_RawData.txt.gz alone (134 MB) exceeds GitHub's file limit.
/route1/data/raw/

# --- Route 1 row-level extracts carrying exact calendar dates -----------------
# Transcriptions of the GSE31312 supplement with per-case diagnosis, progression,
# follow-up and death dates. Regenerated deterministically by
# route1/src/wp1_gse31312_{extract,reconcile}.py from the hashed source PDF,
# so they are not redistributed here.
/route1/manifests/gse31312_table1_clinical.csv
/route1/manifests/gse31312_table2_outcome.csv
/route1/manifests/gse31312_linkage.csv
/route1/manifests/gse31312_reconciled.csv
/route1/reports/gse31312_extraction_discrepancies.csv

# --- Third-party model weights ------------------------------------------------
# models/he.tar is the LyNSeC/HoLy-Net checkpoint (Zenodo 10.5281/zenodo.8065174,
# CC BY 4.0, 452 MB). Provenance and MD5 are tracked; the binary is not.
/models/*
!/models/PROVENANCE.md

# --- Large derived artifacts -> Zenodo deposit, not git -----------------------
*.parquet
*.pt
*.pth
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.zip
*.bin

# --- QC imagery: ~355 MB of overlays and contact sheets -----------------------
# These belong in the Zenodo deposit so reviewers can audit segmentation
# quality. Manuscript figures under reports/preprint/figures/ are NOT excluded.
/kaggle/**/*.png
/kaggle/**/*.jpg
/kaggle/**/*.jpeg
/kaggle/**/*.tif
/kaggle/**/*.tiff
/reports/phase_03_e007_ai_contact_sheets/

# --- LaTeX build artifacts ----------------------------------------------------
# main.pdf and main.bbl are deliberately kept: the PDF is the readable artifact
# and preprint servers frequently require the .bbl alongside the sources.
*.aux
*.fdb_latexmk
*.fls
*.log
*.out
*.blg
*.synctex.gz
*.toc
*.lof
*.lot

# --- Python -------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.venv/
venv/

# --- Local tooling and scratch ------------------------------------------------
/.tmp/
/download.log

# --- Credentials: never commit ------------------------------------------------
# make_and_upload_patches.py reads kaggle.json from $KAGGLE_CONFIG_DIR or
# ~/.kaggle — correct behaviour. This block is belt-and-braces.
kaggle.json
*.pem
*.key
.env
.env.*

# --- OS noise -----------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
